            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy non-**^^Monster^^** unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. Then, your opponent must roll a dice. Inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the difference between the two rolls.
This unit has **^^Strike-last**^^ for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic>
