            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If an enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** was destroyed by this unit&apos;s combat attacks this turn, pick 1 of this unit&apos;s melee weapons to be the target weapon.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. Add the result to the Attacks characteristic of the target weapon for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
